 bidirectional open-drain behavior, potentially contending with other devices.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.98\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"An anomaly is present in the EC I2C SDA path: U4's bus-side SDA is routed through a one-way logic buffer instead of being connected bidirectionally to the controller bus. This is inconsistent with the intended isolated I2C interface and is likely to prevent reliable EC communication.\"\n}",
